9989						; By default, each of the four ADC channels is sampled and converted
9990						; in turn so that each reading is updated every 40 milliseconds. This
9991						; call enables the number of channels to be changed so that if, for
9992						; example, only two channels are required, each will be updated every
9993						; 20 milliseconds.
